msgctxt "196"
msgid "Who the hell is this guy...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"By changing, I assume you mean you were dressing as\r\n"
"a woman to disguise yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"That's right. A couple looks less suspicious. Doesn't\r\n"
"attract as much attention."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "What? You think it's funny? Fine. Laugh all you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"This is how we work best, but the guys in the family always\r\n"
"looked down on us for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"No matter how big of a job we pulled off, they'd laugh and\r\n"
"tell us, \"yakuza don't wear skirts.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Eventually, we had enough and got the hell out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "And you joined the Reapers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"It's hilarious to see yakuza members getting thrashed by\r\n"
"a guy in drag!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"And everyone who sees it thinks some tough guy is getting\r\n"
"the shit beat out of him by a girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Shoots the yakuza's pride all to hell. Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Kind of ironic that guys who used to look down on us are\r\n"
"now getting their asses kicked by us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "That's how you're getting revenge on them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "I wouldn't call it revenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"We're just living our lives the way we want to. And enjoying\r\n"
"the hell out of it, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"I see. Well, you can tell them all about the Reapers over\r\n"
"at the Honest Living Association."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "(Isn't that Mr. and Mrs. Odagiri? Ibuki told me about them.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "(They're splitting up... Who should I follow?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "(The Odagiris are talking to each other again.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "(Splitting up again? I bet the husband's on to me...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "(Guess I'll go after the husband.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "(Huh? He's going outside?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "What do you want with my husband?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "(Damn, I was spotted...)"
msgstr "(Maledizione, mi ha visto!)"

msgctxt "676"
msgid "Huh? What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "This man has been spying on you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "What!? Excuse me, but what the hell are you doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Excuse me, sir! Call the police! This man is harassing\r\n"
"my husband!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "(Uh-oh...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "What seems to be the problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "This man has been stalking my husband!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "Please do something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "You there! Let's see some identification."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "(I don't like the way this is going...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "(Guess I'll go after the wife.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "(She went into the men's room... What's going on?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "(That guy's got the same bag Mrs. Odagiri had.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "Hey, I've got a question for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "1048"
msgid ""
"A woman carrying that exact bag just went into the men's\r\n"
"room. What's the story there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "No idea. Can I go now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "Not yet. I need to find the owner of that bag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "Tell me where she went."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid "You ready...? Huh? Who's this guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "No, see... Aw, to hell with it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "He caught me changing! Let's get rid of him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "What!? Well, no going back now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "Brace yourself, asshole!"
msgstr ""

